  "wikitext": "{{PageDisplay}}\n[[File:Berry Juice.png|left|200px|Berry juice]]\n\n{{Infobox\n |title = [[Products|Product]]\n |level = 31\n |price = 1 to 205\n |time = 3 h\n |source = {{Infoicon|juicepress|bigger|link=Juice Press}}\n |xp = 24\n |base = 57\n |dia = 6\n |time3 = 2 h 33 min\n}}\n'''Berry juice''' is a [[Products|product]] unlocked at [[experience]] level 31.\n\nLike all [[products]], it is stored in the [[barn]].\n\n{{Clr}}----\n==='''Making berry juice'''===\n[[File:Juice Press.png|150px|left|Juice Press]]\nBerry juice is made in the [[Juice Press]].\n\nTo make juice, players need the following ingredients, in the specified quantities:\n{| border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"2\" cellspacing=\"1\" style=\"text-align: center; margin: .5em 0;\"\n|-\n|[[File:Blackberry.png|75px|center|link=Blackberry|Blackberry]]\n|[[File:Raspberry.png|75px|center|link=Raspberry|Raspberry]]\n|-\n|'''x1'''\n|'''x1'''\n|}\nBerry juice takes 3 hours to be produced, but only 2 hours and 23 minutes in a fully [[masteries|mastered]] press. Each bottle gives players 24 [[experience]] points.\n----\n==='''Selling berry juice'''===\n[[File:Roadside Shop.png|150px|left|Roadside Shop]]\n* Berry juice can be bought or sold for a maximum of 2,052 {{Infoicon|coin}} for 10 bottles.\n* Buying the ingredients required to make a bottle costs 128 {{Infoicon|coin}}.\n\n{{Clr}}----\n==='''Boat orders'''===\n[[File:Riverboat.png|150px|left|Riverboat]]\n* [[Boat]] orders ask for 2 to 3 berry juice per crate, up to a total of 12 per boat.\n\n{{Clr}}----\n\n{{Navigation}}\n{{Languages\n|de = Beerensaft\n|es = Zumo de bayas\n|fr = Jus de Baies\n|it = Succo di frutti di bosco\n|nl = Bessensap\n|no = Bærjus\n|ru = Ягодный сок\n|zh = Berry Juice\n}}\n[[pt-br:Suco de amora]]\n\n[[Category:Juice Press Products]]\n[[Category:Raspberry Products]]\n[[Category:Blackberry Products]]",
